{"type":"message","id":"1c7b6ad7","parentId":"c273540f","timestamp":"2026-06-05T06:42:50.986Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-06-05 06:42 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Read the finished article from /tmp/memecoinist-run-20260605-062927/article/final.md and the feature image from /tmp/memecoinist-run-20260605-062927/media/feature.jpg. Publish it to WordPress as a draft. Extract the slug and construct the live URL, save it to /tmp/wp-result.txt, and yield ONLY the URL on success."}],"timestamp":1780641770975}}
